    <l n="53" type="heading" level="2" para="true">§. 1.</l>
    <l n="54" para="true">1. Jusjurandum calumnia explicatur.</l>
    <l n="55" para="true">2. A quibus, &amp; quando præstandum?</l>
    <l n="56" para="true">3. Quid Moribus? 4. Quid jure Canonico?</l>
    <l n="57" para="true">5. Quid jure Feudali?</l>
    <l n="58" para="true">6. Utrum ante Justinianum obtinuerit</l>
    <l n="59">jusjurandum calumnia?</l>
    <l n="60" para="true">7. Advocati etiam præstant juramentum</l>
    <l n="61">calumnia. 8. Quid Moribus?</l>
    <l n="62" para="true">9. Temerarius Litigator in expensas</l>
